# lilac: a LIGHT lavender. The purple family was four themes deep (purple,
# orchid, plum, ultraviolet) and every one of them dark, so this separates on
# lightness rather than adding another dark violet nobody could tell from them.
bar     bg=#d8cce8 fg=#2e2440
window  fg=#f4f0fa bg=#6a4f9a bold
accent  fg=#7a58b0
border  fg=#a89cbc
select  fg=#f4f0fa bg=#785eb4
prompt  bg=#e6dcf2 fg=#2e2440
